TITLE Transport pe question
SOLUTION 0 Initial
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
SOLUTION 1 Inflow
    pH 7 charge
    Na 1
    Cl 1
SOLUTION 2-11 Initial cells
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
